en.JaneDoe_Skill_ExSpecial_Upgrade_Desc:
With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Leaps into the air to launch multiple consecutive kicks forward, then sweeps across, dealing massive <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill, and it is also considered as a <color=#FFFFFF>[Dash Attack]</color>.

en.JaneDoe_Skill_Normal_Upgrade_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform up to 6 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
The 6th hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> is also considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Dash Attack]</color>, and Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

en.Remielle_MathSkill_Desc:
Triggers when another <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Character or a Character from the same Faction is in your squad:
When the number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters in the squad is 1/2/3, entering the battlefield grants all squad members a boost to ATK equal to 6%/12%/40% of Remie's initial ATK, with a maximum increase cap of 1,600, and Daze dealt by this Character while in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase-Shift Flow]</color> state is increased by 6%/12%/35%;
Additionally, when this Character applies <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to an enemy, the enemy also gains the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Hue]</color> effect: while under the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Hue]</color> effect, when the enemy takes Attribute Anomaly DMG, Anomaly Buildup is increased by 15%. When the enemy has no <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Hue]</color> effect expires. After the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Hue]</color> effect expires, the Anomaly Buildup increase effect when the enemy takes Attribute Anomaly DMG persists for an additional 8 seconds.

en.Remielle_Skill_ExQTE_02_Desc:
When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Perform a multi-hit attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
If the attack hits a target, trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>Luminize</color> effect after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:210+AvatarSkillLevel(3)*10.5,1,2}%</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Remielle_Skill_ExSpecial_Desc:
With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Upon entering the battlefield, if the user's Energy is below 60, restore it to 60. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger at most once every 180 seconds;
Launch a large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, apply 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to hit enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Remielle_Skill_Normal_02_Desc:
Hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform a wide-range Slash forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
If the skill hits a target, the Character recovers <color=#FFFFFF>[Feather Gauge]</color> after the skill ends.

en.Remielle_Skill_Normal_03_Desc:
When the Character has <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> stored, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch a powerful large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, restore a large amount of <color=#FFFFFF>[Plume Gauge]</color> for the Character;
If the attack hits a target, trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:100+AvatarSkillLevel(0)*5,1,2}%</color>;
All stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> will be cleared upon activation.

en.Remielle_Skill_Normal_04_Desc:
When the Character has stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> and is in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Mirror Radiance]</color> state, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch a powerful large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, restore a large amount of <color=#FFFFFF>[Feather Gauge]</color> for the Character;
If it hits a target, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:200+AvatarSkillLevel(0)*10,1,2}%</color>;
After activation, all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> will be cleared.

en.Remielle_Skill_Normal_Desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform up to 4 consecutive attacks forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
If a Basic Attack hits the target, the Character recovers <color=#FFFFFF>[Plume Gauge]</color> after the skill ends;
The 4th Basic Attack hit applies 1 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to the target.

en.Remielle_Skill_QTE_Desc:
When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launches a multi-hit large area attack on enemies in front, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
Upon activation, the character enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Radiant Glow]</color> state, upgrading the next <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascading Rainbow]</color> to <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Falling Feather]</color>;
After the skill ends, applies 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to hit enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

en.Remielle_Skill_Special_02_Desc:
Hold <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Enter <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color> after a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>. While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color>, switching characters when the character's <color=#FFFFFF>[Neoma]</color> reaches the maximum value of 120 points allows entry into <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state:
In <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, the character acts autonomously to assist in combat. Some attacks can also apply <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to targets. While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, <color=#FFFFFF>[Neoma]</color> is consumed over time. When <color=#FFFFFF>[Neoma]</color> is fully consumed, the character exits <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state. Before exiting <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, the character cannot be switched in by any means other than a <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>;
If the character triggers 3 <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> reactions while in <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, or if the character's stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> count is greater than or equal to 1 when <color=#FFFFFF>[Neoma]</color> is depleted, the character activates <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Petal Waltz]</color>. Upon activation, Normal Switch-In is unlocked, and the character will automatically trigger <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Petal Waltz]</color> on their next Normal Switch-In;
Upon entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, the character grants all squad members a DMG dealt increase of {CAL:0+AvatarSkillLevel(1)*1.5,1,2}% for 60s; repeated triggers reset the duration;
If the character's <color=#FFFFFF>[Neoma]</color> reaches the maximum value of 120 points and a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> hits an enemy in a <color=#FFFFFF>[Stunned]</color> state, switching characters during the <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> can also trigger entry into <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state;
If no character switch is made after entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color>, the character performs a downward attack to return to the ground.

en.Remielle_UniqueSkill_01_Desc:
Remie's <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> is <color=#2BAD00>0.02%</color> of her own Anomaly Proficiency. When the number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters in the team is 3, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> is additionally increased by 10%;
When a teammate triggers a <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> Reaction for the Character, the Character can store the Anomaly Buildup after <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> as <color=#FFFFFF>[Virtual Radiance]</color>, storing up to the Anomaly Buildup of the 3 most recently triggered Anomaly States;
If <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Feather Waltz]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: Finale]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascading Rainbow]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Falling Feather]</color> hits a target, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends:
Deal Attribute Anomaly DMG to enemies using the skill's corresponding multiplier for all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Virtual Radiance]</color>, and increase this DMG Multiplier based on <color=#2BAD00>0.1%</color> of the Character's own Anomaly Proficiency;
When the Character enters the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Shift]</color> state or after using <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascading Rainbow]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Falling Feather]</color>, all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Virtual Radiance]</color> on the Character will be cleared.

